on augment green\"><span class=\"title\"><a href=\"/page/Augment_Slot\" title=\"Augment Slot\">Green Augment Slot</a></span><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Category:Blue_augments\" title=\"Category:Blue augments\">Blue</a>, <a href=\"/page/Category:Green_augments\" title=\"Category:Green augments\">Green</a>, <a href=\"/page/Category:Yellow_augments\" title=\"Category:Yellow augments\">Yellow</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Category:Colorless_augments\" title=\"Category:Colorless augments\">Colorless</a></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Silent_Avenger_Set_(Legendary)\" title=\"Named item sets\">Silent Avenger Set (Legendary)</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Silent_Avenger_Set_(Legendary)\" title=\"Named item sets\">Silent Avenger Set (Legendary)</a>:</b> 3 Pieces Equipped:<br />You gain a 15% <a href=\"/page/Artifact_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Artifact Bonus\">Artifact Bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Doublestrike\" title=\"Doublestrike\">Doublestrike</a> and <a href=\"/page/Doubleshot\" title=\"Doubleshot\">Doubleshot</a>.<br />You gain +3 Artifact Bonus to Sneak Attack Dice.<br />You gain a 30% Artifact Bonus to Fortification Bypass.<br />You gain +15% Artifact Bonus to Damage vs. Helpless opponents.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Armor Boost</a> +2 or +4<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Armor Boost</a> +2 or +4:</b> +2 or +4 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Physical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Physical Resistance Rating\">Physical</a> and <a href=\"/page/Magical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Magical Resistance Rating\">Magical</a> Resistance Ratings.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD;\" rowspan=\"5\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Vestments_of_Ravenloft.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Vestments_of_Ravenloft.png/420px-Vestments_of_Ravenloft.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"680\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Vestments_of_Ravenloft.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><a href=\"/page/Cauldron_of_Cadence\" title=\"Cauldron of Cadence\">Cauldron of Cadence</a> to <a href=\"/page/Item:Set_Augment:_Perfect_Silence\" title=\"Item:Set Augment: Perfect Silence\">Set Augment: Perfect Silence</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><i>Barovia calls those who have seen its mists, even after they've returned home.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n<p>Can be crafted into the <a href=\"/page/Item:Set_Augment:_Perfect_Silence\" title=\"Item:Set Augment: Perfect Silence\">Perfect Silence</a> <a href=\"/page/Augment_Slot#Set_augments\" title=\"Augment Slot\">set augment</a> for +3 Artifact Bonus to <a href=\"/page/Sneak_attack#Sneak_attack_damage\" title=\"Sneak attack\">Sneak Attack Dice</a>.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817232357\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.099 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.159 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4547/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 35409/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 12442/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4051/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  136.674      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  136.674      1 -total\n 99.78%  136.374     63 Template:IO\n 96.88%  132.411      1 Template:Named_Armor\n 34.20%   46.744      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 33.65%   45.987      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 31.71%   43.336      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 30.36%   41.489      2 Template:InCategory\n 20.52%   28.050     11 Template:Popup\n 14.27%   19.505      2 Template:Augment\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:67170-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817232357 and revision id 681165. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
